data: {"id": "c0ea1b1ff23f46bb-final", "run_id": "c0ea1b1ff23f46bb", "seq": 2457, "ts_ms": 1788441533098, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c 处于 CrashLoopBackOff，app 容器因处理 /work 请求时产生 500 错误并退出（exit code 2）而不断重启 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | `container.waiting_reason` | `CrashLoopBackOff` (fact-4a129d56e7a1) | 确认 Pod 持续重启且正在退避，是集群层面的主要可见状态。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `container.last_terminated_reason` | `Error` (fact-2a7c646cf12d) | 提供上一次容器终止的直接原因。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `container.last_exit_code` | `2` (fact-501e598a688a) | 证实进程异常终止（通常表示运行时错误或程序显式报错退出）。 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | `BackOff` 事件 | `Back-off restarting failed container app` (fact-995bd02741c1) | 验证 K8s 正在根据退避策略处理失败的重启。 |\n| 5 | Logging | `runtime process exiting` | `http_status 500` on `/work` (fact-046b66b804fc) | 揭示容器退出前的业务上下文，指出应用在收到 500 错误后主动退出。 |\n| 6 | Metric | `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` | `1` (Error) (fact-8af9dd40ee1b) | 独立验证了 K8s 层面的终止状态。 |\n| 7 | Metric | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` | `19` (fact-5d8b7dcf691b) | 量化重启频率，说明该问题已持续一段时间。 |\n| 8 | Tracing | L7 Flow (Deepflow) | `GET /work` -> `500` 错误流 (fact-2bd0b7048628) | 证实外部流量确实收到了 500 响应，与日志中的错误码完全吻合。 |\n\n**证据分析：**\n*   **状态闭环：** `K8s State` (fact-1, 2, 3) 和 `Metric` (fact-6) 一致确认了容器以 Error 状态终止且频繁重启。\n*   **根因指向：** `Logging` (fact-5) 和 `Tracing` (fact-8) 在逻辑上紧密关联，日志记录了应用内部在 `/work` 路径发生 500 错误并触发 `runtime process exiting`，而 `Tracing` 证实了 500 状态码真实发生。\n*   **现象映射：** `K8s Event` (fact-4) 解释了为什么容器虽然频繁重启（`Metric` fact-7 显示 19 次），但 Pod 始终处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\n业务代码处理 /work 请求时发生未捕获异常 (日志: http_status 500) → 进程执行退出逻辑 (日志: runtime process exiting) → 容器退出并返回非零状态码 (K8s: exit_code 2) → K8s 重启策略触发 (K8s: CrashLoopBackOff)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n**已确认的根因：** 应用业务逻辑在处理 `/work` 路径请求时发生异常，导致进程主动异常退出，进而触发 Kubernetes 的 CrashLoopBackOff 机制。\n\n该结论由以下证据相互印证支持：\n1.  **直接证据：** `K8s State` 明确记录容器以 `exit_code 2` 退出且原因为 `Error`（证据 #2, #3）。\n2.  **上下文证据：** `Logging` 明确指出容器在发生 `http_status 500` 后执行了 `runtime process exiting`（证据 #5），直接关联了 500 错误与进程终止。\n3.  **佐证证据：** `Tracing` 观测到针对 `/work` 的 `500` 错误流（证据 #8），确认了错误码的真实性。\n\n**证据不足的部分：** 导致 `/work` 路径下产生 `http_status 500` 的具体内部代码逻辑、异常堆栈或依赖错误原因未在日志或追踪中记录（日志模式显示“未包含详细堆栈”），目前仅能确认是应用内部运行时错误导致退出。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 10.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 37.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 564.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c: 564.8s (Evidence 552.2s, RCA 12.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 616.636, "metrics": {"run_id": "c0ea1b1ff23f46bb", "mttr": {"value": "10.3m", "seconds": 616.643452167511, "pass": false, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "54%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.16, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 80%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 616643.452167511, "llm_calls": 13, "llm_duration_ms": 87864.51482772827, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 1060225.6832122803, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 528348.7968444824}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 36979.546785354614, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 564777.7698040009, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 14853.80482673645, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

